      "title": "Oscillations organize neural information",
      "gist": "Brain waves actively organize and route neural signals, and can directly influence spiking through ephaptic electric-field effects, independent of synapses.",
      "question": "Brain waves — how could oscillations control spiking without using synapses? (a candidate mechanism, ephaptic coupling)",
      "sourceHeading": "Oscillations organize neural information"
    },
    "n0038": {
      "id": "n0038",
      "depth": 2,
