        "spya-jnp59d",
        "spya-trb3jf"
      ],
      "title": "Oscillations organize neural information",
      "gist": "Neural oscillations measured as local field potentials or EEG actively organize spiking by segregating it into phases, routing information locally, and enabling long-range communication across cortex.",
      "sourceHeading": "Oscillations organize neural information"
    },
